## get in touch before the call opens

<div class="entry-card">
  <h3>write to me</h3>
  <p><a href="mailto:jordi.abante@ub.edu?subject=FPI%20MINDAI%20-%20your%20name">jordi.abante@ub.edu</a>,
  with the subject line <strong>FPI MINDAI - &lt;your name&gt;</strong>.</p>
  <p>Please attach:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>your CV</li>
    <li>your academic transcript, including the grade average</li>
    <li>a short motivation letter, about half a page: why this project, and what you would bring to it</li>
  </ul>
  <p>This is informal pre-screening. It carries no weight in the official evaluation, and
  it is not a shortlist. Anyone who meets the requirements is welcome to apply through the
  official channel, whether or not they wrote to me first — and getting in touch does not
  mean you can skip the official application.</p>
</div>

